# Define a Slider  a number you drag, expanding to that number #
# Parameters       one slider definition, its bounds as parameters #
# Emotion          the widget IS the control: drag a face #
# Color Picker     helpers are ordinary members of the module #
# Higher-order, Functional Expansion #
#                  an expansion that is a curried function #
# Editable Parameters #
#                  a slider whose bounds are splices, not fixed #
# Tree Care        a model that is a tree, fed by a growth style #
# Timings          what one frame of a livelit costs #
# Dynamic Row or Column #
#                  a row of splices that grows and shrinks #
# Result View      cells that show their results, one formula bar #
# Splices in Text  how a splice is written, and writing one by hand #
# Hygiene          why an expansion cannot capture the client's #
#                  names, nor see them: a folder, a slide per part #
# Expansion Type Errors #
#                  where a mismatch with Expansion is reported, #
#                  for each kind of expand #
